  "id": "critical-incident-stress-debriefing",
  "term": "critical-incident stress debriefing",
  "definition": "Critical-incident stress debriefing is a mental health or wellbeing intervention used after highly distressing work incidents to address people’s psychological stress responses. In the reviewed evidence, it was one of the interventions studied in uniformed service personnel, but its results were mixed.",
